{"seq":7,"slug":"go-language","title":"Go 语言","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language","rating":{"composite":4.2,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.8,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"go-语言-简介\">Go 语言 简介</h1><p>Go 是由 Google 设计并开源的一门静态类型、编译型编程语言。它诞生于 2009 年，由 Rob Pike、Ken Thompson 和 Robert Griesemer 三位计算机科学家联手打造，目标是创建一门兼具系统语言性能和动态语言开发效率的现代编程语言。Go 的设计哲学崇尚简洁，语言规范精炼，关键字数量极少，却能覆盖从命令行工具到大规模分布式系统的广泛应用场景。</p>\n<p>Go 语言最显著的特征是其原生的并发支持。goroutine 和 channel 机制让开发者能够以极低的心智负担编写高并发程序，而无需直接管理操作系统线程。与此同时，Go 的垃圾回收器经过多年优化，暂停时间已降至亚毫秒级别，在自动内存管理和运行时性能之间取得了出色的平衡。</p>\n<p>本手册面向已有其他编程语言经验、希望系统学习 Go 的软件开发者。无论你的背景是 JavaScript、Python、Java 还是 C/C++，都能在这里找到从入门到生产实践的完整路径。</p>\n<p>全书分为六个章节，循序渐进地构建 Go 语言的知识体系。语言基础章节涵盖工具链搭建、类型系统、控制流和函数机制。数据结构章节深入切片、映射、结构体和指针这四种核心数据载体。并发编程章节系统讲解 goroutine、channel、select 模式和同步原语。接口与泛型章节探讨 Go 独特的隐式接口设计以及 1.18 引入的类型参数机制。包与模块章节梳理依赖管理、标准库导览和内部包组织策略。最后的生产实践章节聚焦错误处理模式、测试与基准测试、性能剖析以及 Web 服务开发。</p>\n<p>Go 的成功在于它做出了清晰的取舍——没有继承、没有异常、没有隐式类型转换——这些看似&quot;缺失&quot;的特性恰恰是它在大规模工程中保持代码可读性和可维护性的关键。学完本手册，你将具备用 Go 构建可靠、高效、可扩展系统的能力。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"go-fundamentals","title":"Go 语言基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/go-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"go-toolchain-setup","title":"Go 工具链配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/go-fundamentals/go-toolchain-setup"},{"seq":2,"slug":"types-and-variables","title":"类型与变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/go-fundamentals/types-and-variables"},{"seq":3,"slug":"control-flow","title":"控制流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/go-fundamentals/control-flow"},{"seq":4,"slug":"functions-and-closures","title":"函数与闭包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/go-fundamentals/functions-and-closures"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-structures","title":"数据结构","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/data-structures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"slices-and-arrays","title":"切片与数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/data-structures/slices-and-arrays"},{"seq":2,"slug":"maps-and-sets","title":"Map 与 Set","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/data-structures/maps-and-sets"},{"seq":3,"slug":"structs-and-methods","title":"结构体与方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/data-structures/structs-and-methods"},{"seq":4,"slug":"pointers-and-references","title":"指针与引用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/data-structures/pointers-and-references"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"concurrency","title":"并发编程","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/concurrency","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"goroutines","title":"Goroutines 协程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/concurrency/goroutines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"channels","title":"Channels 通道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/concurrency/channels"},{"seq":3,"slug":"select-and-patterns","title":"Select 与并发模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/concurrency/select-and-patterns"},{"seq":4,"slug":"sync-primitives","title":"同步原语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/concurrency/sync-primitives"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"interfaces-and-generics","title":"接口与泛型","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/interfaces-and-generics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"interface-design","title":"Interface Design 接口设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/interfaces-and-generics/interface-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"type-assertions","title":"Type Assertions 类型断言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/interfaces-and-generics/type-assertions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"generics-in-go","title":"泛型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/interfaces-and-generics/generics-in-go"},{"seq":4,"slug":"constraint-patterns","title":"Constraint Patterns 约束模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/interfaces-and-generics/constraint-patterns"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"packages-and-modules","title":"包与模块","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/packages-and-modules","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"module-system","title":"Module System 模块系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/packages-and-modules/module-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dependency-management","title":"Dependency Management 依赖管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/packages-and-modules/dependency-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"standard-library-tour","title":"标准库导览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/packages-and-modules/standard-library-tour"},{"seq":4,"slug":"internal-packages","title":"Internal Packages 内部包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/packages-and-modules/internal-packages"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"production-go","title":"生产实践","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/production-go","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"error-handling-patterns","title":"错误处理模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/production-go/error-handling-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"testing-and-benchmarks","title":"测试与基准测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/production-go/testing-and-benchmarks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"profiling-and-optimization","title":"Profiling And Optimization 性能分析与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/production-go/profiling-and-optimization"},{"seq":4,"slug":"web-services-with-go","title":"Web Services With Go 网络服务开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-language/production-go/web-services-with-go"}]}]}